# LayoutEditor — the Menu Bar Items pane (菜单栏项). Columns / List view (分栏 / 列表).
"%lld items" = "%lld 项"
  en = {"one": "%lld item", "other": "%lld items"}
# One app with several icons; the singular form only names the count.
"%lld items, which always move together" = "%lld 项，始终一起移动"
  en = {"one": "%lld item", "other": "%lld items, which always move together"}
# Rolltop's own item.
"Always shown" = "始终显示"
"An app started while its section is hidden only shows up here after it has been in the menu bar once." = "在其分区处于隐藏状态时启动的 App，要在菜单栏中出现过一次后才会显示在这里。"
"App" = "App"
"Apps Rolltop hasn’t seen before appear here. Items already in your menu bar keep their section." = "Rolltop 之前没见过的 App 会出现在这里。已在菜单栏中的项保持原有分区。"
"Apps Rolltop hasn’t seen before appear in this section. Drag this to another column to change it; items already in your menu bar stay where they are." = "Rolltop 之前没见过的 App 会出现在此分区。将它拖到另一栏即可更改；已在菜单栏中的项保持不变。"
"Clear filter" = "清除过滤条件"
"Columns" = "分栏"
"Couldn’t open the item: %@" = "无法打开该项：%@"
"Doesn’t fit in the menu bar right now." = "目前菜单栏中放不下。"
"Drag items here" = "将项拖到此处"
"Filter items" = "过滤项"
"Forget" = "忘记"
"Hidden now" = "当前已隐藏"
"Hiding works per app: all of an app’s icons share one section and move together." = "隐藏以 App 为单位：一个 App 的所有图标共用一个分区，并一起移动。"
"Icons that don’t fit in the menu bar go into its overflow menu; Rolltop can’t open items from there." = "菜单栏中放不下的图标会进入溢出菜单；Rolltop 无法从那里打开项。"
"In the menu bar’s overflow menu (no room)" = "在菜单栏的溢出菜单中（空间不足）"
"Items appear in menu bar order, left to right. Rolltop can’t change the order: hold ⌘ and drag icons in the menu bar itself." = "项按菜单栏中从左到右的顺序排列。Rolltop 无法更改顺序：请在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖移图标。"
"List" = "列表"
"Managed by macOS" = "由 macOS 管理"
"Menu Bar Items" = "菜单栏项"
"Move to Always Hidden" = "移到“始终隐藏”"
"Move to Hidden" = "移到“隐藏”"
"Move to Shown" = "移到“显示”"
"New items" = "新项"
# VoiceOver label of the marker; %@ is a section name.
"New items appear here, %@" = "新项出现在此处，%@"
"No items" = "没有项"
"No matching items" = "没有匹配的项"
"Not in the menu bar" = "不在菜单栏中"
"Not running" = "未在运行"
"Notes" = "说明"
"Open Permissions" = "打开权限设置"
"Opens the item’s menu, showing it in the menu bar for a moment if it’s hidden." = "打开该项的菜单；如果它已隐藏，会在菜单栏中短暂显示。"
"Other items" = "其他项"
"Put New Items in Always Hidden" = "将新项放入“始终隐藏”"
"Put New Items in Hidden" = "将新项放入“隐藏”"
"Put New Items in Shown" = "将新项放入“显示”"
"Reveals hidden and always-hidden items while you arrange, until you turn this off or Rolltop hides them again." = "整理时显示隐藏和始终隐藏的项，直到你关闭此选项或 Rolltop 再次将其隐藏。"
"Runs outside the Applications folder, so macOS hides it whenever Rolltop hides anything, whatever its section." = "此 App 在“应用程序”文件夹之外运行，因此只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏它，无论它在哪个分区。"
# %@ is a section name: the section a not-running app keeps.
"Saved in %@" = "已存储于“%@”"
"Section" = "分区"
"Section for new items" = "新项所在分区"
"Shortcuts…" = "快捷键…"
"Show Now" = "立即显示"
"Show hidden items in the menu bar" = "在菜单栏中显示隐藏项"
"Shown in the Rolltop Bar when you click Rolltop’s icon in the menu bar." = "点按菜单栏中的 Rolltop 图标时，显示在 Rolltop 栏中。"
"Shown only when you Option-click Rolltop’s icon." = "仅在按住 Option 键点按 Rolltop 图标时显示。"
"Shown when you Option-click Rolltop’s icon, and behind the disclosure in the Rolltop Bar." = "按住 Option 键点按 Rolltop 图标时显示，也会折叠显示在 Rolltop 栏中。"
"Shown when you click Rolltop’s icon in the menu bar." = "点按菜单栏中的 Rolltop 图标时显示。"
"Stays in the menu bar." = "保留在菜单栏中。"
"Rolltop" = "Rolltop"
"Rolltop can’t read this app’s items right now." = "Rolltop 目前无法读取此 App 的项。"
"Rolltop needs Device Control and Data Access to open menu bar items." = "Rolltop 需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限才能打开菜单栏项。"
"Rolltop needs Device Control and Data Access to see the items in your menu bar." = "Rolltop 需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限才能看到菜单栏中的项。"
"System item" = "系统项"
"The app isn’t running." = "该 App 未在运行。"
"The item didn’t appear in the menu bar in time. If it’s in the overflow menu, make room for it first." = "该项未能及时出现在菜单栏中。如果它在溢出菜单中，请先为它腾出空间。"
"The order of icons is set in the menu bar itself: hold ⌘ and drag an icon. Rolltop can’t change it." = "图标顺序在菜单栏中设置：按住 ⌘ 拖移图标即可。Rolltop 无法更改顺序。"
"These items don’t belong to an app Rolltop can identify, so macOS hides them whenever Rolltop hides any item." = "这些项不属于 Rolltop 能识别的 App，因此只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏它们。"
"These keep their section for the next time they open. Forget one and it follows the section for new items instead." = "这些项会保留所在分区，以便下次打开时使用。忘记某一项后，它会改为遵循新项所在分区。"
"Unknown" = "未知"
"View" = "视图"
"Visible in the menu bar" = "在菜单栏中可见"
"What macOS 27 doesn’t allow" = "macOS 27 不允许的操作"
"While Rolltop hides anything, macOS also hides the items it manages itself, such as AirDrop, Focus and Now Playing. They come back when nothing is hidden." = "只要 Rolltop 隐藏了任何项，macOS 也会隐藏它自己管理的项，例如隔空投送、专注模式和“播放中”。没有项被隐藏时，它们会重新出现。"
"items, icons, sections, shown, hidden, always hidden, apps, layout, arrange, drag, new items" = "菜单栏项, 项, 图标, 分区, 显示, 隐藏, 始终隐藏, App, 布局, 整理, 拖移, 新项"
"macOS hides apps that run from outside the Applications folder whenever Rolltop hides anything, whatever their section." = "只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏从“应用程序”文件夹之外运行的 App，无论它们在哪个分区。"
"macOS hides these whenever Rolltop hides any item, and brings them back once nothing is hidden. Rolltop can’t keep them visible." = "只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏这些项，直到没有项被隐藏时才恢复。Rolltop 无法让它们保持可见。"
"macOS’s id for this system item wasn’t confirmed on a real Mac, so hiding it may not work." = "此系统项在 macOS 中的标识符尚未在真机上确认，隐藏它可能无效。"
# Round 2: reordering in Settings and the "turned off" section. 菜单栏顺序 = the order table; 设置 › 菜单栏 = System Settings › Menu Bar.
"Apps Turned Off in the Menu Bar" = "在菜单栏中关闭的 App"
"Choose File…" = "选取文件…"
"Choose “%@” to let Rolltop read it." = "选取“%@”以允许 Rolltop 读取它。"
"Items appear in menu bar order, left to right. Drop an item on another one in the same row to put it there, or hold ⌘ and drag icons in the menu bar itself." = "项按菜单栏中从左到右的顺序排列。将一个项拖放到同一行的另一个项上即可把它移到那里，也可以在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖移图标。"
"Lets you reorder menu bar items in Settings › Menu Bar Items." = "让你在“设置 › 菜单栏项”中调整菜单栏项的顺序。"
"Lists the apps you turned off in System Settings › Menu Bar. Rolltop only reads this list." = "列出你在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中关闭的 App。Rolltop 只读取此列表。"
"Menu Bar Order" = "菜单栏顺序"
"No apps are turned off." = "没有关闭的 App。"
"OK" = "好"
"Only items that are in the menu bar right now can be reordered." = "只有当前显示在菜单栏中的项才能调整顺序。"
"Open Menu Bar Settings" = "打开菜单栏设置"
"Reading…" = "正在读取…"
"Rolltop can list the apps you turned off in System Settings › Menu Bar once you allow it to read that list." = "允许 Rolltop 读取该列表后，它就能列出你在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中关闭的 App。"
"Rolltop can’t move this item. Hold ⌘ and drag it in the menu bar instead." = "Rolltop 无法移动此项。请改为在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖移它。"
"Rolltop couldn’t keep access to the file you chose." = "Rolltop 无法保留对你所选文件的访问权限。"
"Rolltop couldn’t read the file even after you chose it." = "即使你选取了该文件，Rolltop 仍无法读取它。"
"Rolltop couldn’t read the list of apps turned off in System Settings." = "Rolltop 无法读取在“系统设置”中关闭的 App 列表。"
"Rolltop doesn’t recognize how this version of macOS stores that list." = "Rolltop 无法识别此版本 macOS 存储该列表的方式。"
"That isn’t “%@”. Choose that file in the folder the panel opens." = "这不是“%@”。请在面板打开的文件夹中选取该文件。"
"The new order takes effect the next time the menu bar changes, because Rolltop’s icon is hidden." = "由于 Rolltop 的图标已隐藏，新顺序将在菜单栏下次变化时生效。"
"To reorder items here, allow Rolltop to change the menu bar order." = "要在这里调整项的顺序，请允许 Rolltop 更改菜单栏顺序。"
"Turned off in System Settings" = "已在“系统设置”中关闭"
"Waiting for your answer in the macOS dialog…" = "正在等待你在 macOS 对话框中回复…"
"macOS didn’t apply the new order. Hold ⌘ and drag the icon in the menu bar instead." = "macOS 未应用新顺序。请改为在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖移图标。"
"macOS itself keeps these apps out of the menu bar. Turn them on again in System Settings › Menu Bar." = "这些 App 由 macOS 本身排除在菜单栏之外。可在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中重新打开。"
